          "date": "2026-08-19 12:32:19.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20610 build: Install mount.lustre_tgt symlink",
        "message": "LU-20610 build: Install mount.lustre_tgt symlink\n\n/sbin/mount.lustre_tgt has never been installed, due to four bugs:\n1) $(SERVER) is not a make variable, so the guard is always\n   false and the symlink is never created;\n2) the symlink target is an absolute path under $(DESTDIR),\n   which no longer exists once the package is installed;\n3) the symlink is created in $(sbindir), while mount.lustre\n   is installed in $(rootsbindir);\n4) the spec file lists the path as %ghost, which keeps it\n   out of the package payload.\n\nUse an automake conditional, create a relative link in\n$(rootsbindir), and package the symlink as a regular file.\n\nFixes: 6493d8997e96 (\"LU-17843 build: mount.lustre_tgt as symlink\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Iafbda31f560d237a10529234df6ee77fc4bbc468\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
